        "parseRevision": 1,
        "parseStatus": "parsed",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydoypa-v1-block-001",
            "text": "# 教师科研项目/基金申请评审 测试材料规则来源",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 0
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydoypa-v1-block-002",
            "text": "**范围声明：**本文件用于隔离的合成流程测试，不是正式校规、申报通知、财务审批或法律意见。所有测试身份、编号和金额均虚构。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 1
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydoypa-v1-block-003",
            "text": "## 公开来源与适用边界",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 2
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydoypa-v1-block-004",
            "text": "### 国家自然科学基金资助项目资金管理办法",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 3
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydoypa-v1-block-005",
            "text": "- 来源：https://www.nsfc.gov.cn/publish/portal0/tab475/info81899.htm",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 4
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydoypa-v1-block-006",
            "text": "- 适用范围：国家自然科学基金项目经费规则；仅在项目类型/经费来源确实适用时使用，不直接套用于全部校内科研经费。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 5
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydoypa-v1-block-007",
            "text": "### 成都理工大学进一步完善科研项目和经费管理的实施办法（成理校发〔2024〕20号）",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 6
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydoypa-v1-block-008",
            "text": "- 来源：https://kjc.cdut.edu.cn/__local/0/81/F8/F213AF25A8DDE36DF9DC104CDD3_3BB8AB3B_3BB05.pdf",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 7
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydoypa-v1-block-009",
            "text": "- 适用范围：成都理工大学科研项目经费管理；仍须核对项目类别、预算批复和现行配套制度。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 8
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydoypa-v1-block-010",
            "text": "## 本次审核的规则边界",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 9
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydoypa-v1-block-011",
            "text": "不能仅凭“科研项目”名称套用 NSFC 经费口径。先确定基金种类、预算批复与申报年度指南。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 10
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydoypa-v1-block-012",
            "text": "## 测试要求",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 11
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydoypa-v1-block-013",
            "text": "- 只把来源文件中明确写出的内容当作外部规则。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 12
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydoypa-v1-block-014",
            "text": "- 缺少校内当年通知、审批、积分映射、授权签字或有效性确认时，标记待确认，不要猜测。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 13
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydoypa-v1-block-015",
            "text": "- 证据需要引用案卷中的具体材料与可定位位置。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 14
            },
            "kind": "text"
          },
          {
            "blockId": "doc-1-muydoypa-v1-block-016",
            "text": "- 本文件并非本次模拟数据的答案。",
            "location": {
              "kind": "paragraph",
              "index": 15
            },
            "kind": "text"
          }
        ],
        "usage": "registered",
        "byteHash": "f320405227f7e089c32c50ed42637c410227da5c6e6e6727186ac1491e31f1fc",
        "active": true
      },
